      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2428,
      "text": "O Children of Israel, We rescued you from your enemy, and made an appointment with you[22] on the right side of Mount Tūr [in Sinai], and sent down for you manna and quails[23],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 317,
      "ruku": 273,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2429,
      "text": "[saying], “Eat from the good things We have provided for you, but do not exceed the limits therein, or My wrath will befall you, for anyone upon whom My wrath befalls is perished.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 317,
      "ruku": 273,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2430,
      "text": "I am indeed Most Forgiving to those who repent and believe, and do righteous deeds, then stay on the right path.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 16,
